[INFO]
0=v0.9
1=+ Saving/Loading/Encryption of profile data (AES-256)
2=+ RPM and DEB packages for Mageia / Ubuntu
3=
4=v0.8
5=+ GPG Encryption/Decryption when Saving/Loading list data
6=+ RPM packages for Mageia-9 + AppImage
7=
8=**Note:**  When Saving/Loading data, symmetric `GPG encryption` with a `password` is used. Now you can upload the encrypted list, for example, to the cloud or save it to an external drive and not worry that it will be read by someone, since the `decryption password` is known only to you.
9=
